---

## 19. Project Scope

This repository is intended to investigate the **evidence retrieval** component of automated fact verification.

It does not implement:

- claim detection;
- final evidence-based veracity prediction;
- a complete end-user fact-checking system;
- model quantisation;
- model compression;
- a global production vector database;
- iterative multi-hop retrieval.

These areas are outside the scope of the current experimental work.

---

## 20. Dataset Availability

AVeriTeC is not redistributed through this repository.

The setup notebook downloads the required files from the pinned upstream dataset revision.

Users should refer to the original AVeriTeC project for dataset licensing and attribution requirements.
